WEBVTT

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.920
Yes, you are.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.040
All right, Gene. You know what?

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.680
I'm going to win a medal.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.200
Oh, I am going to win a medal!

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.200
The shiniest medal
this place has ever seen!

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.720
A medal that will be so good

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.840
that it will make Felix's
medals wet their pants!

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.520
And good night!
Thank you for the party.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.240
-Is he serious?
-Oh, please!

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.480
Where's a bad guy
going to win a medal?

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.640
Of course he's not serious.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.120
I've never been more serious
about anything in my life.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.840
That's why I came
straight here, Tapper.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.400
You've never given me a bum steer.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.240
Now, come on. Where can a guy
like me go and win a medal?

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.640
I don't think such a game exists, Ralph.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.280
Oh, come on. You know people.
There's got to be...

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.600
MALE CUSTOMER:
Tapper, I need a root beer.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.200
Coming! Hold that thought.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.480
(VIDEO GAME MUSIC PLAYING)

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.960
Okay. As you were saying.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.040
I was saying,
I can't spend another 30 years

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.480
living alone in the garbage.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.400
I'm not going back without a medal.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.960
Well, I don't know what to tell you.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:14.400
Maybe somebody left a medal here.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.720
You're welcome to dig
through the lost and found.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.480
Okay, let's see what we got here.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.760
Oh! Shoo! Shoo! Go on, get out of here.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.760
Mushroom? No.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.400
What is this? No.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:32.400
Oh, come on, Zangief! Gross.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.480
(SIGHS) Oh.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.120
What am I doing?

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.520
(GRUNTS)

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.720
-Hey, excuse you!
-We are humanity's last hope.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.560
Our mission? Destroy all Cy-Bugs.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.880
We are humanity's last hope.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.560
Uh... You okay there, space cadet?

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.480
We've only been plugged in a week

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:54.000
and every day it's,
"Climb the building, then fight bugs.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.480
"Climb the building, fight more bugs!"

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.800
Yeah, yeah. Right. Look.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.960
Easy on the overalls, spaceman.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.280
It's tough all over, all right?

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.240
And all for what? A lousy medal?

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.000
Medal? You win a medal?

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.920
Yeah, Medal of Heroes.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.920
Ooh. Is it shiny?

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.640
Pretty shiny.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.760
-Ooh! And it says "hero" on it?
-Uh-huh. Oh, yeah.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.160
And you say you win it
by climbing a building?

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:19.960
-And fighting bugs!
-Right, bugs.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.600
Is there any chance I could go
with you to your game

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:24.800
and maybe get one of those medals?

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.760
-Negatory.
-Does that mean maybe?

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.040
No! Look, only the bravest

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:32.040
and the best serve in our corps.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.160
Bug!

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.440
(SCREAMS)

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:36.680
(GROANS)

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.760
Huh.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.360
(SHRIEKS)

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:45.160
We are humanity's last hope.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:48.800
(GRUNTS)

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.760
FEMALE ANNOUNCER ON PA:
Attention!

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:54.400
The arcade will open in five minutes.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.440
Please report to your games.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.600
(GRUNTING)

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:01.160
I can't feel my legs.
What is all this stuff?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.840
(BEEPING RAPIDLY)

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.680
Smells like Ralph in here.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.760
Okay. All right.
What was it called again?

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.720
Hero's something.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.160
Duty. Hero's Duty.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.400
Oh, there it is.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.840
Oh!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.040
(MUTTERING)

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.520
Sorry, Q*bert. It's me, Ralph.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.160
Shh!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:27.880
The wall.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.560
(MUTTERING)

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.240
(KIDS TALKING)

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.000
Morning, kids. Come on in.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.480
Good to see you.
Good to see you. You, too, little fella.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.960
ANNOUNCER OVER PA:
Quarter alert! Quarter alert!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.040
This is not a drill.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.880
Ooh! Sweet golden medal!

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.480
NARRATOR: On a planet with no name

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:02.600
a top-secret experiment
has gone horribly wrong.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.720
You are humanity's last hope.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.240
Rooting-tooting, ready for shooting!
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.720
CALHOUN: All right.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.760
Now listen up, because
I'm only going to say this once.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.400
Fear is a four-letter word, ladies.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.040
If you want to go pee-pee
in your big-boy slacks,

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.400
keep it to yourself.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.920
It's make your mamas proud time!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.240
I love my mama!

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.000
OFFICER: Heads up!
First-person shooter,

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.160
coming through!

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.760
Ooh, robot!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Boop, boop, boop.
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.240
ANNOUNCER OVER PA:
Game play in three, two, one.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.200
We are humanity's last hope.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.280
Our mission?

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.240
Destroy all Cy-Bugs.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.560
You ready, rookie? Let's find out.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.640
Sweet Mother Hubbard!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.760
(SCREAMS)

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.280
RALPH: No, no, no! Wait a second! Aah!

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.800
Cy-Bug, twelve o'clock. Take it, newbie.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.920
RALPH: No, no! Wait, wait!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.480
Watch it, rookie! These monsters
become what they eat.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:16.680
(GRUNTING)

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.640
My gun! Give me that back.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.600
Shoot the eggs before they hatch!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.680
Oh, no!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.320
Something's coming out of their bottom!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.320
-Oh, gross!
-Markowski!

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.000
Get back in formation!

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:35.960
All right, ladies,

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.560
the kitten whispers
and tickle fights stop now.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.400
The entrance to the lab
is straight ahead.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.320
-I'll meet you guys inside!
-No!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.600
Oh! Sanctuary! Sanctuary!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.000
(RALPH GASPS)

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:47.520
(SCREAMING)

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.360
I thought this was going
to be like Centipede!

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:52.600
When did video games
become so violent and scary?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.960
Please, get me out of here!

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.680
-Take her!
-(MOPPET GIRL SCREAMS)

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.400
(ANNOUNCER SPEAKING)

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.040
What a rip-off!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.160
Ah! Get off me! It's game over. Stop it!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.840
SOLDIERS: Beacon up!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.840
OFFICERS: Cease fire! Cease fire!

